{"id":"n26378-1-10","stage":5,"title":"거닐다 · 散步","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26378-1-10-1","ko":"바깥 날씨가 선선한 게 매우 좋아.","zh":"外面的天气这么凉爽，真是太好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바깥","meaning":"外边，外面","explanation":"바깥：外边，外面","readings":[{"term":"바깥","audio":"/audio/e8ec56791b98c029f85b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56330","senseId":"2","lemma":"바깥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바깥","audio":"/audio/e8ec56791b98c029f85b.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨가","audio":"/audio/7f36def9da34b4ea3404.mp3"}},{"text":"선선한","meaning":"凉丝丝，凉爽","explanation":"선선하다：凉丝丝，凉爽；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"선선하다","audio":"/audio/738d8592c1d1233b899d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91699","senseId":"1","lemma":"선선하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선선한","audio":"/audio/0d3ee361b916b7977ecc.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"매우","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"매우：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61510","senseId":"1","lemma":"매우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매우","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"好，晴朗，明媚","explanation":"좋다：好，晴朗，明媚；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"6","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e8ec56791b98c029","term":"바깥","zh":"外边，外面","audio":"/audio/e8ec56791b98c029f85b.mp3","entryId":"56330","definition":"建筑外部没被遮住四周和天空的地方。","pronunciation":["바깓"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"738d8592c1d1233b","term":"선선하다","zh":"凉丝丝，凉爽","audio":"/audio/738d8592c1d1233b899d.mp3","entryId":"91699","definition":"略使人感到凉，柔和而凉快。","pronunciation":["선선하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"6226ddde2c49b372","term":"매우","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/6226ddde2c49b372f0a1.mp3","entryId":"61510","definition":"表示远远超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["매우"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，晴朗，明媚","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"天气风和日丽。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b6baa1af1fb79850b00.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26378-1-10-2","ko":"산책이라도 할 겸 밖에서 잠시 거닐다 올래?","zh":"要不我们出去散散步，稍微走走再回来吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"산책이라도","meaning":"散步","explanation":"산책：散步；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"산책","audio":"/audio/b745d43721954853192d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62506","senseId":"1","lemma":"산책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산책이라도","audio":"/audio/3a6a15386872b459f6f0.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"겸","meaning":"顺便","explanation":"겸：顺便","readings":[{"term":"겸","audio":"/audio/51efba17db275233b633.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30408","senseId":"2","lemma":"겸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겸","audio":"/audio/51efba17db275233b633.mp3"}},{"text":"밖에서","meaning":"外面，外边","explanation":"밖：外面，外边；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"4","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖에서","audio":"/audio/b5f2e1d501f86ee19da3.mp3"}},{"text":"잠시","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}},{"text":"거닐다","meaning":"散步，漫步","explanation":"거닐다：散步，漫步；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"거닐다","audio":"/audio/3fc26ad4be31f2afe758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26378","senseId":"1","lemma":"거닐다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거닐다","audio":"/audio/3fc26ad4be31f2afe758.mp3"}},{"text":"올래?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올래","audio":"/audio/dae28f0afcd406e5ecf4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b745d43721954853","term":"산책","zh":"散步","audio":"/audio/b745d43721954853192d.mp3","entryId":"62506","definition":"为了稍作休息或身体健康而在附近慢慢地走路。","pronunciation":["산ː책"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"51efba17db275233","term":"겸","zh":"顺便","audio":"/audio/51efba17db275233b633.mp3